	"notes": "- 打开文档时自动下载缺失字体，已下载字体可离线使用。\n- 桌面版统一意见反馈入口和表单，可在设置或关于中提交问题与建议；应用错误会上报脱敏诊断信息，不附带文档。\n- 改善反馈类型下拉菜单的选择和键盘操作体验。\n\n## English\n\n- Missing fonts are downloaded when needed; downloaded fonts remain available offline.\n- Desktop feedback now uses a consistent form accessible from Settings and About. App errors send redacted diagnostics without attaching documents.\n- Improved feedback category selection and keyboard interaction.\n",
